    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527027074273280
    m_Localized: "i\xE7in okumak"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 528257339133952
    m_Localized: "Lanet olsun. Sald\u0131r\u0131. Bu bir tuzak, hemen arabaya d\xF6n
      ve buradan uzakla\u015F."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 531595355000832
    m_Localized: "Ara\xE7'a git"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 532728072933376
    m_Localized: "Harika, Alkuda bitti, \u015Fimdi buradan \xE7\u0131kma zaman\u0131.
      \xDCss\xFCn kar\u015F\u0131s\u0131nda bir helikopter var, ona do\u011Fru ilerle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 532921342267392
    m_Localized: "Helikoptere ula\u015F"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533283272953856
    m_Localized: "Alkuda lideri, kamp\u0131n\u0131n ana binas\u0131nda saklan\u0131yor.
      Onu bul ve onunla ba\u015Fa \xE7\u0131k."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533422662258688
    m_Localized: Lideri bul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533581664129024
    m_Localized: "O, ikinci katta saklan\u0131yor. Binan\u0131n yan\u0131nda bir
      merdiven var."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 533640950616064
    m_Localized: Lideri bul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 534071781134336
    m_Localized: "Lanet olsun. Serseri. Helikopteri hacklemem i\xE7in zaman gerekiyor.
      Bekle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 534290308567040
    m_Localized: "\u015Eimdi helikopter bizim. Gidelim buradan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 534533855023104
    m_Localized: dk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 534582836105216
    m_Localized: Kalan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 534605191745536
    m_Localized: Dayan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 538816067440640
    m_Localized: "Ay\u0131, ar\u0131 kovan\u0131na bal \xE7almaya al\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015F.
      Ar\u0131c\u0131, sadece t\xFCfe\u011Fini al\u0131r almaz, hemen a\u011Faca
      t\u0131rman\u0131r, yakalanamaz.\r\nNeyse ki bir gazetede \u015Fu ilan\u0131
      g\xF6rd\xFC: 'Her t\xFCrl\xFC hayvanla ba\u015Fa \xE7\u0131kar\u0131m.' Bu
      uzman\u0131 \xE7a\u011F\u0131rd\u0131, bir saat sonra t\xFCfek omuzda b\xFCy\xFCk
      bir adam ve k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir k\xF6pek olan Snowball ile geldi.\r\nArkada\u015F\u0131n\u0131
      tan\u0131tt\u0131:\r\n\r\nBu kar beyaz, bize \xE7ok yard\u0131mc\u0131 olacak.\r\nVe
      ar\u0131 kovan\u0131na, ay\u0131ya gittiler, o da onlar\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCnce
      hemen a\u011Faca \xE7\u0131kt\u0131. Adam, ar\u0131c\u0131ya t\xFCfe\u011Fi
      verir ve a\xE7\u0131klar:\r\nBen \u015Fimdi a\u011Faca \xE7\u0131kaca\u011F\u0131m
      ve ay\u0131y\u0131 a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131 ataca\u011F\u0131m ve Snowball i\xE7eri
      girecek, poposuna t\u0131rm\u0131klayacak ve onu parampar\xE7a edecek. Anlad\u0131n
      m\u0131?\r\nAnlad\u0131m, ama neden t\xFCfek?\r\nE\u011Fer ben d\xFC\u015Fersem,
      Snowball'u vur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 538756860645376
    m_Localized: "Ay\u0131 ve k\xF6pek Kar top"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539243160834048
    m_Localized: "Bombalar, benim bombalar\u0131m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539315223171072
    m_Localized: Bombalar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 539610586058752
