  - m_Id: 571610835488768
    m_Localized: "\xC7iviler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 572760146087936
    m_Localized: "Anne, o\u011Fluna okula \xF6\u011Fle yeme\u011Fi haz\u0131rl\u0131yor:\r\n\u2014
      \u0130\u015Fte, s\u0131rt \xE7antan\u0131n i\xE7ine ekmek, sosis ve \xE7iviler
      koydum.\r\n\u2014 Anne, neden??\r\n\u2014 Peki ya nas\u0131l, ekmek al\u0131rs\u0131n,
      onun \xFCzerine sosis koyar ve yersin.\r\n\u2014 Peki \xE7iviler?\r\n\u2014
      \u0130\u015Fte i\u015Fte, i\u015Fte onlar!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 574682726961152
    m_Localized: "Anne babama inand\u0131m bo\u015Funa, \"18 ya\u015F\u0131na geldi\u011Finde
      istedi\u011Fin gibi olursun\" dediklerinde. \u015Eimdi 25 ya\u015F\u0131nday\u0131m,
      ama hala Batman de\u011Filim."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
